WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
On Friday night, many Jewish
husbands sing to their wives:

2
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.980
a woman of valour, worth far above rubies.

3
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:13.210
The Qur'an teaches that God placed love
and mercy between husband and wife.

4
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.940
And Christians share a command with Jews:

5
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.460
honour your father and your mother.

6
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.530
All three see the family as God-given.

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.960
So why do some believers keep old
roles, while others change them?

8
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.270
In this mission, you'll compare Christian,

9
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.170
Muslim and Jewish teaching on
roles, bringing up children,

10
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.880
caring for the elderly, and divorce.

11
00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.820
Then you'll weigh up reasons for
keeping tradition and for change,

12
00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.390
and the strain that change can bring.

13
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:46.630
Your mission: find out why some believers
keep old family roles while others change

14
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.070
them.
